			"notes": "## Copper Companions v1.0.1 - NeoForge\n\nCompatibility update for NeoForge 21.9.16-beta.\n\n### Changes\n\n- Updated to NeoForge 21.9.16-beta\n- Fixes mod list screen crash in newer NeoForge versions\n\n#### **Don’t open the Mod List screen**\n\n- **:x: Known issue**: NeoForge 21.9.16-beta has a mod list crash (not our bug)\n- **Recommendation**: Use NeoForge 21.9.5-beta until the upstream issue is fixed\n- If you must stay on 21.9.16-beta, avoid clicking **“Mods”** on the main menu.\\\n  The game runs fine otherwise\n\n### Technical Details\n\n- Built with ModDevGradle 2.0.107\n- Uses Parchment mappings 1.21:2024.11.10\n- Full NeoForge API compatibility\n\n### Configuration\n\nConfigure via config/coppercompanions-common.toml"
		},
